<div class="page-content">
        <div class="section section-z-top " id="section-intro" >
    <span class=section-id id="intro"></span><div class="bg"></div>
    <section>
      






    <h2 class="heading section_title ">Settle Every Trade On Time</h2>








<div class="row none">
    <div class="column_8 ">
                <div  class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    <div><p>Settlement-driven Securities Lending and Borrowing is a popular service offered by SIX.</p>
<p>Securities Lending and Borrowing is a complex business covering trading, settlement instructions, collateral management and loan management.</p>
<p>Our services will enable you to access this business in an efficient manner while reducing risk and maximizing profit on lending fees.</p></div></div>
        </div></div>
    <div class="column_4 ">
                <div class="figure featured cta ">
 
    <div class="clearfix">
        
        <div class="cell">
            <div class="paragraph_title">Contact Us</div>
            <p>The SIX Repo-Infodesk is pleased to be your single point of contact for any questions you may have.</p>
            
    
    
    <a class="buttonlink" href="https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/securities-services/contacts/repo-infodesk.html" target="_self">
        <i class="fa sp-person-callcenter"></i>
        Talk to Us
    </a>

        </div>
    </div>
</div></div>
    </div>



    




</section>
    </div>
<div class="section section-z-top " id="section-benefits" >
    <span class=section-id id="benefits"></span><div class="bg"></div>
    <section>
      






    <h2 class="heading section_title ">How You Will Benefit</h2>








<div class="row featured borderedColumns">
    <div class="column_4 align-center">
                <div class="iconbox">
        <div class="icon large pull-top">
                <i class="fa sp-piechart  "></i>
                    </div>

            <h3 class="paragraph_title">Profit from Lending Fees</h3>
            <div class="iconbox-text">
                <p>Sixty percent of the lending fees are charged to the borrower and passed on to the lender, thus generatinga significant increase in revenue.</p>
<span class="teaser-link"></span>
                </div></div></div>
    <div class="column_4 align-center">
                <div class="iconbox">
        <div class="icon large pull-top">
                <i class="fa sp-banknote  "></i>
                    </div>

            <h3 class="paragraph_title">Remain the Beneficial Owner</h3>
            <div class="iconbox-text">
                <p>As a lender, you continue to benefit from all rights and all dividend income generated by the securities.</p>
<span class="teaser-link"></span>
                </div></div></div>
    <div class="column_4 align-center">
                <div class="iconbox">
        <div class="icon large pull-top">
                <i class="fa sp-exchange  "></i>
                    </div>

            <h3 class="paragraph_title">SecLend (Bilateral)</h3>
            <div class="iconbox-text">
                <p>Delivery versus delivery settlement in real time reduces risk significantly.</p>
<span class="teaser-link"></span>
                </div></div></div>
    </div>

</section>
    </div>
<div class="section bg-rock sectoin-bg-img section-low section-z-top color-inverted " id="section-cta" >
    <span class=section-id id="cta"></span><div class="bg"></div>
    <section>
      <div class="row none">
    <div class="column_3 ">
                <h2 class="heading section_title ">Need Expert Advice?</h2></div>
    <div class="column_9 ">
                <div  class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    <h3 class="chapter_title">
                We are looking forward to answer any questions you might have.</h3></div>
        </div>
<div class="button_link">
    <!-- Use download attribute: -->
            <a class="btn btn-header-standard btn-normal btn-primary
                   btn-inline  " href="#contact" target="_self"><span class="screenreader">Contact Us</span></a></div></div>
    </div>

</section>
    <div class="section-img">
        <img alt="Man looking at his SIX iD screen and checking out the latest news to stay informed" class="js cover cover-y-center cover-x-center" data-six-img='{"source":{"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/market-data/id-bg-overlay.png","width":1420,"height":700},"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/market-data/id-bg-overlay.six-image.[FORMAT].[WIDTH].png","original":[80,160,240,510,720,1020,1250,1420]}'></div>
    </div>
<div class="section section-z-bottom " id="section-about" >
    <span class=section-id id="about"></span><div class="bg"></div>
    <section>
      






    <h2 class="heading section_title ">About This Service</h2>











<div class="spacer-v spacer-v--large "></div><div data-six-textimage="left" class="textimage ">
    <div class="figure ">
                <div class="fig image-medium">
                        <figure>
            <img data-six-img='{"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/securities-services/securities-finance/securities-lending-and-borrowing/1-Fair-Trade-908x510px.six-image.[FORMAT].[WIDTH].png","standard":[80,160,240,510,720]}'></figure></div>
                <div class="cell">
                        <h3 class="chapter_title">
                Beneficial Ownership</h3><div><p>Although ownership of the securities is transferred from lender to borrower for the duration of the loan, the lender remains the beneficial owner. This means that all rights and income accruing from the securities are credited to the lender.&nbsp;</p>
<p>We make sure that the corresponding compensation payments are automatically passed on from borrower to lender.&nbsp;</p></div></div>
                </div>
        </div>



<div class="spacer-v spacer-v--large "></div><div data-six-textimage="right" class="textimage ">
    <div class="figure ">
                <div class="fig image-medium">
                        <figure>
            <img data-six-img='{"source":{"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/securities-services/securities-finance/securities-lending-and-borrowing/2-Speed-and-Capacity-908x510px.png","width":908,"height":510},"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/securities-services/securities-finance/securities-lending-and-borrowing/2-Speed-and-Capacity-908x510px.six-image.[FORMAT].[WIDTH].png","original":[80,160,240,510,720,908]}'></figure></div>
                <div class="cell">
                        <h3 class="chapter_title">
                SecLend (bilateral)</h3><div><p>Our securities lending product enables bilateral trading.&nbsp;</p>
<p>SecLend is fully automated – from the trade all the way through to settlement. With SecLend, settlement risks are largely eliminated thanks to delivery versus delivery (DVD) settlement in real time. This opens up a lending opportunity for you, offering new sources of income and attractive business possibilities, while ensuring the lowest possible operating risks.</p></div></div>
                </div>
        </div>

</section>
    </div>
